  "description": "Fast BIP-39 seed derivation (PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512, salt \"mnemonic\", 2048 iterations, 64-byte seed) with native multi-buffer SIMD (AVX-512 / AVX2 / SSE2, runtime-dispatched) and an internal pinned worker pool: one call derives a whole batch across all cores. Bit-exact with Rfc2898DeriveBytes, several times faster per core, and ~2.6x the throughput of managed Parallel.ForEach over the same kernel. Native libraries for linux-x64 and win-x64 are bundled.",
